@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
hide empty description
[*] --> NoRun
NoRun : no certified coverage
Accumulating : union of measured-true [start,end)
Satisfied : covered duration >= duration

NoRun --> Accumulating : Measured true certificate
Accumulating --> Accumulating : touching / overlapping\nMeasured true certificate
Accumulating --> Satisfied : coverage reaches duration
Satisfied --> Satisfied : continuing Measured true
Accumulating --> NoRun : false or non-Measured evidence,\nquality fault (reset floor)
Satisfied --> NoRun : false or non-Measured evidence,\nquality fault (reset floor)
Accumulating --> NoRun : source or clock epoch change\n(new chain)
Satisfied --> NoRun : source or clock epoch change\n(new chain)
note bottom of Accumulating
  NoObservation: NotReady, no coverage added.
  Duplicates never advance coverage.
  Malformed input: rejected, committed state unchanged.
end note
@enduml
